## Changes Made

| Element | Before (Old) | After (Style Guide) |
|---------|-------------|---------------------|
| Primary color | Purple `#7C6AEF` | Orange `#FF9500` |
| Font | Inter | **Montserrat** |
| Background | `#111` | `#0F0F0F` |
| Surface | `#1a1a2e` | `#1A1A1A` |
| Buttons | Flat purple | **Gradient orange + glow shadow** |
| Cards | Simple border | **Orange border + hover glow** |
| Forms | Plain inputs | **Glass effect + orange focus ring** |
| Radius | 8-12px | **12-20px** |
| Animations | Basic | **fadeInUp, scaleIn, shake, pulse** |
| Logo SVG | Purple fill | **Orange `#FF9500` fill** |

